// Standalone workspace for the Wails desktop app. It shadows the monorepo's
// root go.work so `go`/`wails` invoked inside app/desktop build this module in
// isolation. Desktop imports only Runtime's public localruntime deployment
// handoff package through its module-local replacement; it does not add the
// Runtime module or its backend graph to this workspace. Without this file, a
// build here walks up to ../../go.work and loses that isolation.
go 1.27.0

use .
